{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05283","headline":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制 · 萧至忠","name":"奉和幸安乐公主山庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西郊窈窕凤皇台，北渚平明法驾来。\n匝地金声初度曲，周堂玉溜好传杯。\n湾路分游画舟转，岸门相向碧亭开。\n微臣此时承宴乐，髣髴疑从星汉回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧至忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}